  "pages": 11
 },
 "summary": "A series of thick film chip resistors with the resistive film on both faces of the substrate (one face in 0402), rated for high power and high pulse loads. Eight sizes from 0402 to 2512, including the wide 1218, cover 1 Ω to 1 MΩ at ± 0.5 %, ± 1 % or ± 5 % with ± 100 or ± 200 ppm/K, plus 0 Ω jumpers. P70 runs from 0.2 W (0402) to 1.5 W (1218, 2512), and up to 3.5 W at a terminal temperature of 105 °C. AEC-Q200 qualified, for automotive, industrial, commercial and high power use such as battery management.",
